# S9-C3h108a: actual Einstein--Cartan skew-coframe response operator

This dependency-light action module constructs the complete simple-`B`
principal response on the full 24-dimensional skew coframe first-jet carrier.
For every jet, it integrates the jet to an actual affine coframe `U`, derives
`B := II⁺(U)`, differentiates the actual BF momentum, and proves that the
resulting coordinate operator is exactly the displayed closed form.

The operator is therefore an action readout, not a residual coordinate table.
Its inverse and bijectivity are proved only after this generic actual binding.
No source target, endpoint, residual, zero-fiber witness, preimage receipt, or
stationarity certificate enters the construction.
-/

